OL,3,AArran ferry evacuated over 'bomb
OL,4,Athreat' by passenger rescued from sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 23-year-old man has been arrested
OL,7,Fafter a ferry service on Scotland's
OL,8,Fwest coast was evacuated over a bomb
OL,9,Fthreat.
OL,11,FOperator CalMac said a passenger was
OL,12,Freported overboard on the MV Caledonian
OL,13,FIsles 16:40 service, carrying 329
OL,14,Fpeople from Brodick on the Isle of
OL,15,FArran.
OL,17,FThe BBC understands that after being
OL,18,Fpulled from the sea by the ferry's
OL,19,Frescue boat, the man then told crew
OL,20,Fthat there was a bomb on board.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
