OL,3,AArran ferry evacuated over 'bomb
OL,4,Athreat' by passenger rescued from sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll passengers were removed on foot at
OL,7,FArdrossan so the vessel could be
OL,8,Fsearched. Police Scotland said it was
OL,9,Festablished that the threats "were not
OL,10,Fcredible".
